The legal texts are the Constitution of the State of Nevada and chapters 111, 193, 200 and 205 of the Nevada Revised Statutes, as published by the Nevada Legislature (Legislative Counsel Bureau) (leg.state.nv.us). Statutes and constitutions are
not copyrightable subject matter (Georgia v. Public.Resource.Org, 2020); only the law text is taken, never annotations, notes
or editorial material. The bytes were read from Internet Archive captures of the official pages; the Legislature is the publisher.
Source: the Nevada Legislature (Legislative Counsel Bureau), leg.state.nv.us.

The arrangement of this repository, its tables, commit messages and tools are by Lexifina and may be reused under
the Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International licence (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/). This
repository is not legal advice and not an official publication.
